  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.32px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/09/14241463_1047443652013285_2617187626898415454_o.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.32px;\">(56 fotos) Kids&amp;Us, school of english, ha ampliado su centro&nbsp;<span style=\"line-height: 19.32px;\">en la Plaza Corts Valencianes, 9 (bajo) de Onda. Han</span><span style=\"line-height: 19.32px;\">&nbsp;preparado m&aacute;s aulas y el mobiliario es nuevo. Se puede recibir informaci&oacute;n sin compromiso</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; line-height: 19.32px;\">&nbsp;en el tel&eacute;fono 656 59 89 09 o en el correo electr&oacute;nico onda@kidsandus.es.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.32px;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampussetembre16/14089124_1050783655012618_3775198810289984525_n.jpg\" alt=\"14089124_1050783655012618_3775198810289984525_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampussetembre16/14125532_1050783291679321_2222612570523547093_o.jpg\" alt=\"14125532_1050783291679321_2222612570523547093_o\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampussetembre16/14199417_1050789515012032_4522305820280456535_n.jpg\" alt=\"14199417_1050789515012032_4522305820280456535_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/kidsampussetembre16/14199604_1050783581679292_70716